  "decision_date": "05/05/2004",
  "description": "Erection of two storey, two bedroomed dwellinghouse to infill land between Nos 42 & 38 Whitestile Road.",
  "site_name": "40",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "25/03/2004",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": null,
  "street_name": null,
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Major all other major developments",
  "lapsed_date": "04/05/2009",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - It is considered that this application for a new dwellinghouse ,  because of its position, design and appearance, would be acceptable having due regard for the site characteristics of Whitestile Road and is complementary to the visual amenity of the locality and would not be detrimental to the amenities of adjoining and neighbouring properties.  The development is in accordance with Policies ENV-B 1.1 (New Development), H4.1 (Housing Standards and Guidelines), H6.3 (Backland Development/ Infill development) and\r\nT 1.4 (Car and cycle parking and servicing facilities for developments)\r\n of the London Borough of Hounslow UDP, Adopted December 2003.\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the new house hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing terrace of houses.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development Order) 1995 (or any order revoking or re-enacting that order) no enlargement of the premises or any additional structures/buildings within the curtilage of the site shall be carried out.",
    "Condition : 5 - The building hereby permitted shall not be occupied at any time other than for purposes ancillary to the residential use of the dwelling known as 40 Whitestile Road.",
    "Condition : 6 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8am  to 6pm  on Mondays to Friday and  8am  to 1pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and public holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - No development shall take place until there has been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority a plan indicating the positions, design, materials and type of boundary treatment to be erected.  The boundary treatment shall be completed before  the building is occupied or agreed in writing with the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details.",
    "Condition : 8 - Details shall be provided of sound insulation against internally generated noise and shall be submitted and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the  building is occupied.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details.",
    "Condition : 9 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission."
  ],
